        <item>
            <title>0.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:06:57 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Swiitch now silently checks for updates ~5s after launch — no need to use the menu bar item.</li>
                    <li>Accessibility permission is now monitored continuously. If you revoke it while Swiitch is running, the Welcome window auto-opens with a one-click path back to System Settings; re-granting reinstalls the hotkey without restart.</li>
                    <li>Default shortcut for "current app's windows" changed from ⌥+\` to ⌥+Tab.</li>
                    <li>Preferences → About now has a Check for Updates button.</li>
                    <li>Build numbers now derive from git commit count so Sparkle stops offering "0.1.2 → 0.1.2" updates after every install.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/pernielsentikaer/swiitch/releases/download/v0.1.2/Swiitch-v0.1.2.zip"
                length="1865019"
